      "lang": "python",
      "source": "l, r = 0, len(nums) - 1\n\nwhile l < r:\n    total = nums[l] + nums[r]\n    if total == target:\n        return [l + 1, r + 1]\n    if total < target:\n        l += 1\n    else:\n        r -= 1"
